div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> EX3 Lunars \u2013 So far, so good. </div> </div> </div>I want it! I'm so hyped!<br /> <br /> Also, the fact that they decided to Kickstart TCFBtS now instead of after the holidays hopefully means Lunars is coming soon? I... I feel like it's closing in on a Kickstarter, but it's hard to tell.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8097-wern212","name":"wern212","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-18T01:48:56-08:00","id":1275046,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wern212</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1275012-monday-meeting-for-12-17-18?p=1275035#post1275035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I want it! I'm so hyped!<br /> <br /> Also, the fact that they decided to Kickstart TCFBtS now instead of after the holidays hopefully means Lunars is coming soon? I... I feel like it's closing in on a Kickstarter, but it's hard to tell.</div> </div> </div> </div>They previously listed doing KS art for Lunars, so it's coming up - likely either the next one or the one after, depending on where the CofD Hunter 2e KS goes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-18T02:35:08-08:00","id":1275050,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1275012-monday-meeting-for-12-17-18?p=1275046#post1275046\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They previously listed doing KS art for Lunars, so it's coming up - likely either the next one or the one after, depending on where the CofD Hunter 2e KS goes.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know, it's so exciting. My body is ready. My wallet isn't.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8097-wern212","name":"wern212","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-18T02:47:50-08:00","id":1275051,"title":"","content":"I guess they'll want to consider the Kickstart of Lunars in relation to the release of Dragonblood (which I assume they'll be keen to do no later than March) to build interest but not over-strain wallets.<br /> <br /> Of course, there's probably a general feeling of trying to keep monentum lost during the Core book process, but that's something you always do if you can.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-18T08:52:01-08:00","id":1275088,"title":"","content":"Has anyone gotten started with any DB games yet since the Kickstarter? I've already finished one story arc with my players and have started on the second one. As much as I'd like to play around with Lunars, I'm super happy to continue the DB game for quite a while longer, but this time with art in the book. ^^","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":482,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","user":"Ekorren","date":". 12-18-2018, 12:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-18T09:14:39-08:00","id":1275095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ekorren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1275012-monday-meeting-for-12-17-18?p=1275088#post1275088\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has anyone gotten started with any DB games yet since the Kickstarter? I've already finished one story arc with my players and has started on the second one. As much as I'd like to play around with Lunars, I'm super happy to be continue the DB game for quite a while longer, but this time with art in the book. ^^</div> </div> </div> </div>I have played several games with only one PC in it (which is how I usually play Exalted). I've found that DB's tend to be significantly lower power level than solars (duh), but that with their charms that can still be quite cool and fun to play. I do wish Essence 3 was easier to get to because Signatures are super cool and we don't often get to play with them<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8097-wern212","name":"wern212","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-18T09:17:54-08:00","id":1275096,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wern212</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1275012-monday-meeting-for-12-17-18?p=1275035#post1275035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I want it! I'm so hyped!<br /> <br /> Also, the fact that they decided to Kickstart TCFBtS now instead of after the holidays hopefully means Lunars is coming soon? I... I feel like it's closing in on a Kickstarter, but it's hard to tell.</div> </div> </div> </div>They\u2019ll presumably want Lunars to have finished going through Manuscript Approval before the KS, which might entail some editing depending. So they still have however much development they need to do as well as all the approvals before the KS can start. That said, They Came From will run through the middle of January, so they\u2019re unlikely to start another one before late February, so who knows.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-18T15:27:38-08:00","id":1275181,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ekorren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1275012-monday-meeting-for-12-17-18?p=1275088#post1275088\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has anyone gotten started with any DB games yet since the Kickstarter?</div> </div> </div> </div>The game in which I play the Knight Raiton, one of the other players is a Lookshyan DB.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-18T16:51:18-08:00","id":1275207,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ekorren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1275012-monday-meeting-for-12-17-18?p=1275088#post1275088\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has anyone gotten started with any DB games yet since the Kickstarter?</div> </div> </div> </div>I've been playing a Water Aspect in a game with two Solars (well, one's a homebrewed Abyssal, but similar power level). I feel like the power of the Dragon-blooded is very specific, but when you find that niche they can really shine. They can get really impressive rolls using auto-success, reroll, and exploding dice Excellencies, but only in two or three applications of an Ability, depending on what elemental aspect the Charms are. For instance, my Water Aspect has been scarier on Intimidate rolls than the Dawn thanks to Burning Dragon Mien, Dragon Mariner Attitude, and the Presence Excellency. However, the Dawn is making broader uses of her Presence, rather than just big Intimidate actions. I've had a lot of fun finding the ways to make my Charms work for the situation that we are in, rather than just having a huge power answer to most things like a Solar (which is fun in its own right, don't get me wrong). Also, the universal DB anima power of manipulating your element for a mote is incredible stunt fodder. Need higher Defense? Sure is hard for these attacking ocean critters to swarm me when I swirl the water into a whirlpool around myself!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13696-knurlurzhad","name":"Knurlurzhad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13696_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-19T05:06:42-08:00","id":1275266,"title":"","content":"Errata thread is up as of very early this morning so probably means emails go out today.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12596-alpharius","name":"Alpharius","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12596_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}